# The exact denial each document in token-bypass.yaml must produce.
# scripts/test-policy-fixtures.sh compares this whole set: a message that
# disappears is a weakened rule, a message that appears is an unreviewed
# denial. File-level rejection alone hides both.
Pod token-bypass must use only ServiceAccount naranjo-online
container token-bypass must declare a cpu limit
container token-bypass must declare a cpu request
container token-bypass must declare a memory limit
container token-bypass must declare a memory request
volume stolen-api-token is outside the exact ephemeral/credential volume allowlist for namespace naranjo-online
volume stolen-api-token must not project a ServiceAccount token
